<title>USA: Knight-Ridder sets six pct share buyback.</title>
<headline>Knight-Ridder sets six pct share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Knight-Ridder Inc said on Thursday its board had approved the repurchase of another six percent of the company's outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The authorization is part of an ongoing share buyback program, Knight-Ridder Chairman and Chief Executive Officer P. Anthony Ridder said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company has repurchased over 21 million shares, or about 18 percent of its outstanding stock, over the past three years, he said.</p>
<p>Ridder said the company was now allowed to buy back about 7.2 million shares, including some left over from a previous authorization.</p>
</text>
